{"type":"message","id":"bba96293","parentId":"eb904bd3","timestamp":"2026-04-11T14:59:32.715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the files. The naming convention seems to be:\n- `Ⱥ��_` prefix for group chats (群聊)\n- `˽��_` prefix for private chats (私聊)\n\nThese are showing as garbled text due to encoding issues but I can identify the patterns:\n- `Ⱥ��` = 群聊 (group chat)\n- `˽��` = 私聊 (private chat)\n\nThe files are all in the same folder with both .json and .txt formats for each contact/group.\n\nNow I need to organize them into a proper structure. Let me create folders:\n- `私聊_JSON/` - private chat .json files\n\n\n- `私聊_TXT/` - private chat .txt files  \n- `群聊_JSON/` - group chat .json files\n- `群聊_TXT/` - group chat .txt files\n\nI'll create these folders and move the files to their appropriate locations.","thinkingSignature":"e610aafd1fe23482e0642b442c4219e429c654bfb8acdc2f30e604078d456fdd"},{"type":"text","text":"看到文件了。文件前缀能识别：\n- **`˽��_`** = 私聊\n- **`Ⱥ��_`** = 群聊\n\n我来按群聊/私聊 + 文件格式分类整理，给你看一下分类计划确认一下：\n\n| 分类 | 文件数 |\n|------|--------|\n| 私聊 .json | ~180 |\n| 私聊 .txt | ~180 |\n| 群聊 .json | ~24 |\n| 群聊 .txt | ~24 |\n\n**确认一下：** 你是想：\n1. **移动文件**到分类好的子文件夹（原文件夹会变空）\n2. 还是只是**生成一份清单**给我看看分类结果就好？\n\n另外原文件名里有乱码（编码问题），整理时要不要我**重命名成正常中文**？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9993,"output":363,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43190,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775919560223,"responseId":"062994c608d2a6775b88523b64c2bbc6"}}
