{"type":"message","id":"901da25b","parentId":"1dd1ea12","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:00:09.809Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Move files to categorized subfolders\n2. NOT rename the files to normal Chinese (keep original names)\n\nSo the plan is:\n- Create folder `私聊_json` and move all `˽��_*.json` files there\n- Create folder `私聊_txt` and move all `˽��_*.txt` files there\n- Create folder `群聊_json` and move all `Ⱥ��_*.json` files there\n- Create folder `群聊_txt` and move all `Ⱥ��_*.txt` files there\n\nLet me do this with PowerShell.","thinkingSignature":"ce08a35691133eb63ff80ed87c0a288ead2fd25614a16beb45d5159b83e54469"},{"type":"text","text":"好，保持原文件名不变，直接按分类移动。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wli2soouefrj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\n\n# 创建四个分类子文件夹\nNew-Item -Path \"$src\\私聊_json\" -ItemType Directory -Force\nNew-Item -Path \"$src\\私聊_txt\" -ItemType Directory -Force\nNew-Item -Path \"$src\\群聊_json\" -ItemType Directory -Force\nNew-Item -Path \"$src\\群聊_txt\" -ItemType Directory -Force\n\n# 移动私聊文件\nGet-ChildItem -Path \"$src\" -File | Where-Object { $_.Name -cmatch '^˽��_' } | ForEach-Object {\n    $ext = $_.Extension\n    if ($ext -eq '.json') { $dest = \"$src\\私聊_json\" }\n    elseif ($ext -eq '.txt') { $dest = \"$src\\私聊_txt\" }\n    Move-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force\n}\n\n# 移动群聊文件\nGet-ChildItem -Path \"$src\" -File | Where-Object { $_.Name -cmatch '^Ⱥ��_' } | ForEach-Object {\n    $ext = $_.Extension\n    if ($ext -eq '.json') { $dest = \"$src\\群聊_json\" }\n    elseif ($ext -eq '.txt') { $dest = \"$src\\群聊_txt\" }\n    Move-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force\n}\n\n# 汇总结果\n@(\n  \"私聊_json: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\私聊_json' -File).Count) 个文件\"\n  \"私聊_txt: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\私聊_txt' -File).Count) 个文件\"\n  \"群聊_json: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\群聊_json' -File).Count) 个文件\"\n  \"群聊_txt: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\群聊_txt' -File).Count) 个文件\"\n  \"剩余文件: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src' -File).Count) 个\"\n) -join \"`n\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":141,"output":620,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":10055,"totalTokens":43650,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919595797,"responseId":"062994eaa740ab815c3369e3669733c5"}}
