{"type":"message","id":"98380252","parentId":"8e043d47","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:00:24.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The summary line at the end shows 0 files in each folder and 0 remaining - but that can't be right since there were hundreds of files. The issue is that the summary variables are using single-quoted strings so `$src` wasn't expanded. But the move commands should have worked since the folder creation succeeded.\n\nWait, the output also shows the directories were created. But the counts are all 0 and the \"remaining\" count is also 0, which means either:\n1. The files were moved successfully and all counts are 0 because there are no remaining files\n2. Something went wrong\n\nActually wait - looking at the output more carefully, the four directories were created. The counts at the end are all 0 because the summary lines used single quotes so `$src` wasn't expanded. \n\nThe real issue is that the file move summary is unreliable with the single-quoted strings. Let me just check what's actually in those directories to see if the files were moved successfully.","thinkingSignature":"f5226135f930f79fc5dd769724e6aac529739128bda4f932550d69fd1b78dd09"},{"type":"text","text":"文件夹创建成功了，但统计汇总有变量引用问题。来验证一下实际移动结果：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pwwn2rvez3ee_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\nWrite-Host \"=== 各分类文件夹文件数 ===\"\nWrite-Host \"私聊_json: $((Get-ChildItem \"$src\\私聊_json\" -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"私聊_txt:  $((Get-ChildItem \"$src\\私聊_txt\" -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"群聊_json: $((Get-ChildItem \"$src\\群聊_json\" -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"群聊_txt:  $((Get-ChildItem \"$src\\群聊_txt\" -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"根目录剩余:    $((Get-ChildItem $src -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"\"\nWrite-Host \"=== 各文件夹部分文件示例 ===\"\nWrite-Host \"--- 私聊_json ---\"\nGet-ChildItem \"$src\\私聊_json\" -File | Select-Object -First 5 Name\nWrite-Host \"--- 群聊_json ---\