{"type":"message","id":"b89d142c","parentId":"3b1cf8e1","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:00:32.874Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the issue is clear now - all 400 files are still in the root directory, and the subfolders are empty. The match pattern `^˽��_` and `^Ⱥ��_` isn't matching the filenames. This is likely a character encoding issue - the characters displayed as `˽��_` and `Ⱥ��_` in the console might not actually be those exact characters in the filesystem.\n\nLet me check the actual first bytes of a filename to understand the encoding.","thinkingSignature":"0372892643a2b265b346f3d3ba944fdfa45258f61f167d9ae1c289c82e7f6dbf"},{"type":"text","text":"文件没移动成功，根目录还剩400个。匹配模式有问题——编码对不上。让我先看看实际的文件名前几个字节是什么字符：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w3kbftd0d2ca_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\n$f = Get-ChildItem $src -File | Select-Object -First 1\n$bytes = [System.IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($f.FullName)[0..10]\nWrite-Host \"File: $($f.Name)\"\nWrite-Host \"First bytes: $($bytes -join ',')\"\n# 尝试不同编码解析\n$iso = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding(\"iso-8859-1\")\n$gbk = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding(\"gbk\")\nWrite-Host \"ISO-8859-1 decode: $(($bytes | ForEach-Object { $iso.GetString([byte]$_) }) -join '')\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12423,"output":306,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45563,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919624873,"responseId":"0629950725171ad6d9d9c2ee2fa0d41b"}}
