{"type":"message","id":"7e4c16d4","parentId":"b00642bc","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:01:00.936Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the problem. The first character `˽` has bytes `CB BD` in the default system encoding (which on a Chinese Windows is likely GBK or GB2312). In GBK, `CB BD` corresponds to the character `私`. So the prefix is `私` (0xC7, 0xBD in GBK or similar).\n\nWait, actually in GBK encoding:\n- `CB BD` = 私 (0xC6BD in GBK... let me recalculate)\n\nActually GBK uses 2 bytes for Chinese characters. Let me check what `CB BD` decodes to in GBK.\n\n\nI'm getting confused about the byte offsets. Let me just work with the fact that GBK encoding confirms the filename is `私_11.json`, and since the file starts with `CB` as the first byte, I can use a simple byte prefix match to identify files beginning with that character.","thinkingSignature":"792bbf8ce84ee4743c359be54e75fa6a347e651c1283b621a74bf740a6e5b53b"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！文件名前缀字节是 `CB BD`（GBK编码的\"私\"）和 `D8 E7`（\"群\"）。用字节匹配来处理：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_apmero2sf62e_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\n\n# GBK编码的私和群的2字节前缀\n# 私 = CB BD (GBK)\n# 群 = D8 E7 (GBK)\n$siPrefix = @(0xCB, 0xBD)\n$qunPrefix = @(0xD8, 0xE7)\n\nGet-ChildItem $src -File | ForEach-Object {\n    $nameBytes = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding('gbk').GetBytes($_.Name)\n    $ext = $_.Extension\n    \n    if ($nameBytes[0] -eq $siPrefix[0] -and $nameBytes[1] -eq $siPrefix[1]) {\n        $dest = if ($ext -eq '.json') { \"$src\\私聊_json\" } else { \"$src\\私聊_txt\" }\n    } elseif ($nameBytes[0] -eq $qunPrefix[0] -and $nameBytes[1] -eq $qunPrefix[1]) {\n        $dest = if ($ext -eq '.json') { \"$src\\群聊_json\" } else { \"$src\\群聊_txt\" }\n    } else {\n        $dest = $null\n        Write-Host \"未匹配: $($_.Name)\" \n    }\n    \n    if ($dest) {\n        Move-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force\n    }\n}\n\n# 验证结果\nWrite-Host \"\"\nWrite-Host \"=== 移动完成，验证结果 ===\"\nWrite-Host \"私聊_json: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\私聊_json' -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"私聊_txt:  $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\私聊_txt' -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"群聊_json: $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\群聊_json' -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"群聊_txt:  $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src\\群聊_txt' -File).Count) 个\"\nWrite-Host \"根目录剩余:   $(@(Get-ChildItem '$src' -File).Count) 个\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13254,"output":715,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46803,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919643613,"responseId":"0629951a0dd74c1cb2a8f6ca892848bc"}}
