{"type":"message","id":"25061ae7","parentId":"10c414e0","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:01:26.378Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so there are several issues:\n1. The \"群\" prefix bytes I guessed (D8 E7) are wrong for some files - those files with names starting with \"Ⱥ��_\" in the console output (which are actually garbled) are not matching. Let me figure out the correct bytes.\n2. The subfolders were created but the verification paths are using the wrong encoding again in the summary.\n\nBut importantly - the validation section is showing 0 for everything, and the \"未匹配\" (unmatched) output shows that the group chat files didn't match the `D8 E7` prefix.\n\nWait - actually the files listed as \"未匹配\" all start with what appears as \"Ⱥ��_\" in the console output - these are the group chat files! And there were also files that started with what the console showed as \"Ⱥ��_\" that seem to have been matched earlier (the ones starting with `Ⱥ��_`).\n \nSo I'm realizing the display encoding and actual character encoding are getting mixed up here. When the console shows \"Ⱥ��_\" it's using a different encoding than what the file system actually uses, so I need to figure out what the real GBK bytes are for the group chat prefix. Let me sample a few of these unmatched files to see what their actual first two bytes are. I'm realizing the GBK encoding for 群 is actually C8 BA, not what I thought earlier. And 私 is C9 B1, not CB BD - I mixed up the byte values when reading them back. Let me recalculate the GBK codes more carefully: 私 should be 0xC9F0 and 群 should be 0xC8BA based on the GBK table. I'm working through the GBK encoding table systematically - the high byte 0xCB falls in the C8-CF range which maps to GBK 2344-2363, but I need to find what 0xBD maps to in that section. Rather than trying to decode character by character, let me just examine the actual first two bytes of the group chat files directly to see what encoding is really being used.","thinkingSignature":"493e86a2bd0fdff7e4e849bb8811b7df2e8693d474ac2a80028f96e362b80289"},{"type":"text","text":"\"群\"字的GBK字节搞错了，需要重新检测。先看几个群聊文件名的实际首字节：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0apawkmtyhax_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\n# 看几个群聊文件的实际前2字节(GBK)\nGet-ChildItem $src -File | Where-Object { $_.Name -like 'Ⱥ*' } | Select-Object -First 5 | ForEach-Object {\n    $gb = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding('gbk').GetBytes($_.Name)\n    Write-Host \"$($_.Name) -> bytes: $($gb[0].ToString('X2')) $($gb[1].ToString('X2'))\"\n}\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15874,"output":612,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919661921,"responseId":"0629952c6cd4664b62afe9f6c1bc3809"}}
