{"type":"message","id":"28cc783d","parentId":"e075b7aa","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:02:57.529Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so:\n1. Copy succeeded\n2. Remove succeeded  \n3. Source remaining JSON: 1 (moved from 2 to 1)\n\nSo the `Move-Item` was silently failing but `Copy+Remove` worked. The `Move-Item -Force` must be failing due to some issue. The copy+remove worked.\n\nNow let me copy back the json and move the remaining txt file using copy+remove.\n\nActually, let me just do copy+remove for all remaining files.","thinkingSignature":"bed400c2b7bb33a5700f64695d91e0156ba1793c4096a2d1ece83fe18b6b109b"},{"type":"text","text":"`Move-Item`静默失败了，改用 Copy+Remove 来处理剩下的文件：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qfczb4i3c1pj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\n\nGet-ChildItem $src -File | ForEach-Object {\n    $gb = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding('gbk').GetBytes($_.Name)\n    $ext = $_.Extension\n    if ($gb[0] -eq 0xCB -and $gb[1] -eq 0xBD) {\n        $dest = if ($ext -eq '.json') { \"$src\\私聊_json\" } else { \"$src\\私聊_txt\" }\n        Copy-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force\n        Remove-Item -Path $_.FullName -Force\n        Write-Host \"Done: $($_.Name)\"\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"\"\nWrite-Host \"根目录剩余: $((Get-ChildItem $src -File).Count) 个\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21195,"output":330,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54359,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919768432,"responseId":"06299597179f5adedb3a31a2247f908f"}}
