{"type":"message","id":"806541d7","parentId":"43a2cda9","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:03:32.457Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so the issue is that `Remove-Item` doesn't support `-PassThru`. But the Copy succeeded. Let me fix the script.","thinkingSignature":"a6ffedbf3da000c9995ddc4a14d6f50681bd2c1371d87d38b9ce75e4b007e9e7"},{"type":"text","text":"`Remove-Item` 不支持 `-PassThru`，修复一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kle0cxxkiqpz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\nGet-ChildItem $src -File | ForEach-Object {\n    $gb = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding('gbk').GetBytes($_.Name)\n    if ($gb[0] -eq 0xCB -and $gb[1] -eq 0xBD) {\n        $ext = $_.Extension\n        $dest = if ($ext -eq '.json') { \"$src\\私聊_json\" } else { \"$src\\私聊_txt\" }\n        Copy-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force\n        Remove-Item -Path $_.FullName -Force\n        Write-Host \"已移动: $($_.Name)\"\n    }\n}\nWrite-Host \"根目录剩余: $((Get-ChildItem $src -File).Count) 个\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":23017,"output":252,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56103,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919806796,"responseId":"062995bd35b530476d4143823ecfc0ca"}}
