{"type":"message","id":"7c42509b","parentId":"40f3278b","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:03:44.300Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 2 remaining! The Copy succeeded but Remove failed. The issue might be that the files were copied to the destination but the source files can't be removed. Maybe they're locked or something.\n\nWait, let me check the destination folders. The files ARE being copied (since we see \"已移动\") but they remain in the source. And the count stays at 2.\n\nActually, let me look at whether these might be symbolic links or have some special attribute.\n\nOr wait - could it be that Copy-Item creates the file but the source file stays because Remove-Item is failing? The error messages about \"PassThru\" being an invalid parameter showed that the Remove-Item line itself wasn't the issue... \n\nBut now without PassThru, Remove-Item should just work silently. Let me add error handling to see what's actually happening.","thinkingSignature":"c943ce77697e02ab4039345cc22f4c7f057500cae135be33443bcc5ebcac5fcc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_upr4iap3fbv8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\nGet-ChildItem $src -File | ForEach-Object {\n    $gb = [System.Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding('gbk').GetBytes($_.Name)\n    if ($gb[0] -eq 0xCB -and $gb[1] -eq 0xBD) {\n        $ext = $_.Extension\n        $dest = if ($ext -eq '.json') { \"$src\\私聊_json\" } else { \"$src\\私聊_txt\" }\n        try {\n            Copy-Item -Path $_.FullName -Destination \"$dest\\\" -Force -ErrorAction Stop\n            Write-Host \"Copy OK: $($_.Name)\"\n        } catch {\n            Write-Host \"Copy FAIL: $($_.Name) -> $_\"\n        }\n        try {\n            Remove-Item -Path $_.FullName -Force -ErrorAction Stop\n            Write-Host \"Remove OK: $($_.Name)\"\n        } catch {\n            Write-Host \"Remove FAIL: $($_.Name) -> $_\"\n        }\n    }\n}\nWrite-Host \"剩余: $(Get-ChildItem $src -File | Measure-Object).Count\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":23345,"output":440,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56619,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919812816,"responseId":"062995c38b96917332bc7f72285483aa"}}
