{"type":"message","id":"daebdc99","parentId":"138c3ed7","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:04:21.204Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! `[System.IO.File]::Delete()` says the file no longer exists after deletion (Deleted: False means the file is gone), and the remaining count is 0. But `[System.IO.File]::Exists()` returned False right after Delete, which means the file is indeed gone.\n\nWait, the output is confusing me. `Deleted: False` means `[System.IO.File]::Exists($fullName)` returned `False`, which means the file DOES NOT exist after the delete call - so the delete succeeded. And the \"Remaining: 0\" confirms there are no files left.\n\nSo the files have been successfully moved! Let me do a final count.","thinkingSignature":"405e5c38541e0cb750eee733f98c85dfae514e62643b8208b7d84736d95437c2"},{"type":"text","text":"文件已删，Remaining: 0。让我做最终验证：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ipl7cymf3yya_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\n$src = \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\texts\"\nWrite-Host \"=== 最终分类结果 ===\"\n(Get-ChildItem $src -Directory) | ForEach-Object {\n    $c = @(Get-ChildItem $_.FullName -File).Count\n    Write-Host \"$($_.Name): $c 个\"\n}\nWrite-Host \"根目录剩余: $((Get-ChildItem $src -File).Count) 个\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":25614,"output":260,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58708,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919852386,"responseId":"062995ebf3525c85f49218d6ae5c28ac"}}
